{"data":{"body":"**[P3] Synchronize the mid-step pause test**\n\nA fixed 50 ms sleep does not guarantee that `step1` has started. On a loaded runner, the execution can be paused before its first invocation and the assertions still pass without exercising mid-step token revocation. Wait for the `StepStarted` event or use explicit thread synchronization before pausing, then resume and assert the final `s1s2` result to cover the checkpoint-derived deferred invocation.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOPsIIsM75hrv_","finding_digest":"897017c096f5fcd8a6ce58edf31c0cd4c6411b6d7dd16f1c94f7fc2a768fa649","finding_id":"arf_v1_rfybpqew6x6nrjwoldw7gham2t","finding_key":"testing/e2e/pause_resume_test.py::test_pause_mid_step_holds_back_the_next_step::unsynchronized-precondition","identity_key":"testing/e2e/pause_resume_test.py::test_pause_mid_step_holds_back_the_next_step::unsynchronized-precondition","line":100,"observation_digest":"98f891d3765e398249d895dfbdc3d545e177a11a6b7c3266fd799505bf9d7fd1","observation_id":"aro_v1_td4jdu3wly4yesoysxp33q6vix","path":"packages/aws-durable-execution-sdk-python-testing/tests/e2e/pause_resume_test.py","prior_finding_id":"arf_v1_rfybpqew6x6nrjwoldw7gham2t","published_at":"2026-10-05T16:32:53Z","review_id":"arr_v1_q5cwmoh7dgmjqhfg25zyxblkpe","reviewed_base_sha":"631b78d1b505b157eee758662291fc5e2353bbb6","reviewed_head_sha":"c234aaf4d40e248ff3e8eed1d673c10a34df05c5","reviewer":"codex","start_line":100,"suggestion_id":""},"pull_request":{"number":757},"record_id":"art_v1_x5cttgyb6pzqtulxrnba2bbf4j","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-10-05T16:32:53Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-python","id":1052903600},"schema_version":1}
